Feature: TC_21_STAFF - iNet Add Payments Tab to the Applications Menu E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Pack for Add Payments Tab" (BISSAGL-7245, AT-TC-01, tmslink BISSAGL-14785)
  # Rewritten 16-10-2026. This is an iNet (agent) test, so it uses the agent login steps of the BISS iNet packs
  # (stepdefinitions.TC_03) and the Applications / Payments steps added to StaffSteps.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   On the agent farmer dashboard, Applications / Payments has a scheme year dropdown and Land Details and Payments
  #   tabs, and the Payments tab of a herd without payments says "There are no records to display".
  #
  # Test data (kept as literals, as in legacy):
  #   Agent aga6128 and herd N1142057, set by "the run uses agent ... and herd ...". Password: TD:Password and the
  #   test OTP from the TestData row of this test case. If the herd is marked "Herd expired" on My Clients, the
  #   dashboard step takes a replacement herd from the database (as in the BISS iNet packs) - the no-records check
  #   then needs a herd without payments.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.TC_03 (agent login, farmer dashboard),
  #                   stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps (Applications / Payments screen)
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the run uses agent "aga6128" and herd "N1142057"
    And the agent user is on the login page
    When the agent logs into the application with valid credentials and OTP
    And the agent opens the "Basic Income Support for Sustainability" application
    Then the agent should land on the BISS Home page
    And the agent navigates to the "Home" and "My Clients" Left Menu Link

  @regression @inet @payments @e2e
  Scenario: AT-INET-PAYMENTS-TAB-E2E-01 - The agent sees the Payments tab on Applications / Payments

    # SECTION 1 : Applications / Payments - scheme year, Land Details, Payments, no records - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-14785)
    When the agent opens a farmer dashboard using herd data
    And the agent opens the "Applications / Payments" farmer dashboard screen
    Then the Applications / Payments screen should offer the scheme year, Land Details and Payments
    And the Payments tab should show the message "There are no records to display"
